{"id":"n28130-2-40","stage":2,"title":"치르다 · 处理 ","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28130-2-40-1","ko":"어머님 장례는 잘 치르셨어요?","zh":"您母亲的葬礼办得顺利吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머님","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머님：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머님","audio":"/audio/82b7122898a050234986.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74396","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장례는","meaning":"葬礼","explanation":"장례：葬礼；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장례","audio":"/audio/87ae25ef136108da3d4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24801","senseId":"1","lemma":"장례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치르셨어요?","meaning":"处理 ，操办，办理，经受，考","explanation":"치르다：处理 ，操办，办理，经受，考；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"치르다","audio":"/audio/554eb01d72384969cdfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28130","senseId":"2","lemma":"치르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82b7122898a05023","term":"어머님","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/82b7122898a050234986.mp3","entryId":"74396","definition":"(尊称)在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머님"]},{"id":"87ae25ef136108da","term":"장례","zh":"葬礼","audio":"/audio/87ae25ef136108da3d4f.mp3","entryId":"24801","definition":"人死后埋在地里或火葬。","pronunciation":["장ː녜"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"554eb01d72384969","term":"치르다","zh":"处理 ，操办，办理，经受，考","audio":"/audio/554eb01d72384969cdfa.mp3","entryId":"28130","definition":"经历某事。","pronunciation":["치르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a9e9c63be6b0050a0de.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28130-2-40-2","ko":"네, 덕분에 잘 마쳤어요.","zh":"是的，多亏大家帮忙，顺利办完了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마쳤어요.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/61e9357b8d09422b9af0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.191,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28130","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":